        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Emtek 1303US19 Low Profile Concealed Wheel Barn Door Hardware Kit</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Low Profile Concealed Wheel Barn Door System contains everything you'll need to install your sliding barn door(s). The Flat Track comes in 6 lengths to fit openings up to 8 feet wide for single or double door applications.  It will accommodate door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" with a maximum combined door weight of 400 pounds.  The minimalist design of this barn door set combined with the durable flat black powder coat finish over steel complements most design esthetics.  Along with the anti-jump design to keep the sliding door from easily coming off the track, this Barn Door Kit also offers an optional a soft open and close system for quiet operation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Also Available: <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/low-profile-concealed-wheel-stainless-steel-barn-door-kit-emtek-1303ss-1212271\">Low Profile Concealed Wheel Stainless Steel Barn Door Kit</a></i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-B1303-Installed.jpg?v=1718159565\" width=\"173\" height=\"333\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek B1303 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Concealed Wheel Barn Door Kit:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material:  Powdercoated Steel</li>\r\n<li>Track Length: 60\" (5 feet) to 192\" (16 feet)</li>\r\n<li>Track Face: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Track Thickness: 1/4\" Steel </li>\r\n<li>For door openings 36\" (3 feet) to 96\" (8 feet)</li>\r\n<li>For wood doors up to 400 LBS.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  Flat Black</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-B1303-Specifications.pdf?v=1718159609\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek B1303\r\n Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-B1303-Install.pdf?v=1718159609\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek B1303 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Barn Door Kit Contents:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Steel Track</li>\r\n<li>(2) Hangers with Wheels</li>\r\n<li>Anti-Jump Mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Track Stops</li>\r\n<li>Floor Guide</li>\r\n<li>Optional Soft Open/Close Kit</li>\r\n<li>Additional Hanger Kit Available for Double Door (DD) Applications</li>\r\n<li>Installation Hardware Kit Includes:</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Track Screws</li>\r\n<li>Posts with 3 Spacers</li>\r\n<li>Anti-Crush Spacers for 1/2\" and 5/8\" Drywall</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Low Profile Concealed Wheel Barn Door Kit, Emtek 1303US19",
                "description": "This Low Profile Concealed Wheel Barn Door System contains everything you'll need to install your sliding barn door(s). The Flat Track comes in 6 lengths to fit openings up to 8 feet wide for single or double door applications.  It will accommodate door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick with maximum combined door weight of 400 pounds.  This barn door track set comes in a durable flat black powder coat finish over steel to complement any design esthetic.  Along with the anti-jump design to keep the sliding door from easily coming off the track, this Barn Door Kit also offers an optional a soft open and close system for quiet operation.",
